  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "On the current build, loading avatars when travelling to another world or loading from the menu doesn't seems to behave completely as intended.\n\nFrom what I observed, it is probably using the last saved state before the update and not saving new changes.\n\nAfter you use \"reset avatar\", however, it will always load the defaults even if you make new changes, still not saving said changes.\n\n(I only tested in Desktop since I don't own any VR headset)",
